# Root-level ignores (project lives in creditverse-platform/)
*.zip
.DS_Store
node_modules

# The Supabase project lives in creditverse-platform/supabase/ — never here.
#
# Running `supabase link` (or any CLI command) from this directory creates a
# root-level supabase/.temp holding link state but NO migrations. A later
# `supabase db push` run from here then reads that empty directory, finds none
# of the applied versions, and reports "Remote migration versions not found in
# local migrations directory" — which looks exactly like migration drift and
# invites a `migration repair` that would falsify a correct history.
#
# Ignored so a stray one is never committed again. If this path reappears,
# delete it and re-run the command from creditverse-platform/.
/supabase/
.vercel
.env*
